OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run prisoner Gary Anderson
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn on-the-run prisoner who absconded
OL,7,Fduring his father's funeral in Northern
OL,8,FIreland 10 days ago has appeared in
OL,9,Fcourt in the Republic of Ireland, where
OL,10,Fhe was arrested on Wednesday.
OL,12,FGary Anderson, 29, appeared at a
OL,13,Fspecial sitting of Letterkenny District
OL,14,FCourt on Thursday following his arrest
OL,15,Fat a campsite in Fahan, near Buncrana,
OL,16,Fby An Garda Siochana (Irish police).
OL,18,FGarda Det Jason Conroy gave details of
OL,19,Fthe arrest, charge and caution during
OL,20,Fthe hearing.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
