OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run prisoner Gary Anderson
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court was told Gary Anderson is
OL,7,Fcharged with being present at Fahan
OL,8,FMarina caravan and campsite on 23
OL,9,FSeptember, having escaped from
OL,10,FMaghaberry Prison, contrary to Section
OL,11,F3(1) of the Criminal Law (Jurisdiction)
OL,12,FAct 1976.
